customer: nice_guy
problem: broken_hard_drive
brief:
	A calm errand.
	The Skater picks up his defragged computer this evening, with a special dialogue: he is hooked and needs it back.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hi there! No rush at all, I know you're busy.
- Welcome to CompuFun! Wet out there?
- You seem a bit... moist?
(happy) It's pouring. But the plants are happy, so I'm happy.
- So, how can I help you?
- Anyway, what seems to be the problem?
(problem) My computer starts, and then the whole screen goes blue with white text.
- Ah, the Blue screen of death...
	(neutral) Wh-what did you say?
	- Um... nothing! Nothing... I'll take a look at it as soon as possible!
- Ouch, that's not very good.
	(problem) That's what I thought too!
	- Good news is that I'll probably be able to fix it.
- A very nice clue. I'm sure I can fix it in a jiffy.
(happy) I'm so relieved! See you soon!
- Take care out there!

== pick-up
(problem) So, did you get to the bottom of that blue screen?
- Yep! All fixed now!
- No more blue!
(happy) You're a star!
- Just doing my job. Have a Funtastic day!
